abstract: >-
  IST artifact freeze (v2.0.0): experimental infrastructure and three frozen
  pilot campaigns for evaluating oracle-gated behavioural repair of
  LLM-generated finite state machines. Includes JSON schemas, deterministic
  scoring and patch application, diagnostic projection, analysis scripts,
  Tier-A table and figure regeneration, tests, and frozen 90-slot pilot arms
  (default, operation-aware, operation-inferred repair representation).
keywords:
  - finite state machines
  - behavioural repairability
  - empirical protocol
  - software engineering empiricism
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - model-based testing
